# Harness, not library. `spec/14-security.md` §9.3's fuzzer, the cross-language
# benchmarks, the conformance-corpus generator and the test suite are all part
# of how this package is *developed and verified*, not of what it *is* — so they
# stay out of the published archive, as their equivalents stay out of the Java
# jar and behind a non-default feature in the Rust crate.
